# Skill Edit Checklist

Before and after modifying any skill, read the skills overview `README.md`
(at `.fork-skills/README.md`) and follow the **Change Impact** table:

| If you change…            | Also review…                                              |
|---------------------------|-----------------------------------------------------------|
| install-env               | test-runner (env setup steps)                             |
| test-runner               | cherry-pick-assistant (Step 3 b1 gate, Step 6 b2 verification) |
| detect-upstream-base      | cherry-pick-assistant (Step 1 v1 detection), auto-cherry-pick (Step 1) |
| cherry-pick-assistant          | auto-cherry-pick (Step 4 invocation, Step 5 summary fields) |
| auto-cherry-pick               | (no downstream dependents)                                |

## Required Steps

1. **Read** `.fork-skills/README.md` to see the full dependency graph.
2. **Propagate** any interface changes (parameter names, step numbering, output
   format) to all downstream skills listed in the table above.
3. **Update the README itself** if you add, remove, or rename a skill, change
   the dependency graph, or alter shared notation.
